==Strategy==
Basic strategies for [[Zombie Outbreaks]] apply here and you don't really need anything else over enemy coverage as the non-[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemies here are barely threatening at all.

Be wary of Zang Roo's lengthy burrow and 100% HP revive. Still, constant meatshielding and a few [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]]/[[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombies]] should be more than enough for this stage.

